<title>JAPAN: Seirei up,Shoun ask-only on merger.</title>
<headline>Seirei up,Shoun ask-only on merger.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Seirei Industry Co Ltd were higher while those of Shoun Machine Tool Co Ltd were ask-only in Tuesday afternoon trade after the firms announced plans to merge on Friday, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0549 GMT, Seirei's shares were up six yen at 441 and Shoun Machine's shares were ask-only at 195 yen after finishing at 245 on Friday.</p>
<p>The markets were closed on Monday for a national holiday.  </p>
<p>The firms said they would merge on November 21 with three Shoun shares exchanged for every Seirei share.</p>
</text>
